**Subject:** Time to Disposition Macro and SharePoint Update

Hi Brooke,

The Time to Disposition macro is ready.

To run it:

1. Open the workbook and click Enable Content if a yellow bar appears
2. On the first tab, click the Run Report button
3. When the file browser opens, select the Time to Entry file and click Open

That is it. The macro fills in the CountySummary and Statewide tabs on its own, including the year over year chart.

One note: you do not need to paste anything into the reference tab. The macro does not read from it. Selecting the file in step 3 is the only way data comes in.

